{
    "_id": "bon-soiree",
    "name": "Bon Soirée",
    "instructions": "1. Rim a chilled glass with tajin.\n2. Combine the ingredients in a shaker with ice.\n3. Shake to chill, then strain into the prepared glass.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "description": "This cocktail from Hailey Knight and Casey Knight (no relation) of Charleston's Félix Cocktails et Cuisine takes the spicy Margarita for an extra-savory spin. Saline lends a saltiness, while Lillet Blanc rounds out the edges of the fresh lime juice. Meanwhile, Knight recommends using your favorite hot sauce to spice it up. \"The key is to use a vinegar-based hot sauce to complement the cocktail’s flavors rather than compete with them,\" she says. \"I’m partial to Slap Ya Mama hot sauce.\"",
